      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْرَبَ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a canker-worm) <i>pierced holes
in,</i> or <i>eroded,</i> a tree. (K.) IJ derives this verb
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَرَابٌ</span>, (TA,) q. v.

